  "name": "Cursed!: Reflection ignores dodged and fully absorbed hits",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. Reflection reads the final damage after the hit roll and absorbs. With Major",
    "Reflection 901852 on the player, swings the target dodges (dodge fixture 100%) and swings a Power Word:",
    "Shield 48066 absorbs completely deal no damage, so no 901856 reflection is dealt. A dodged swing that",
    "reflected would make every swing reflect, so the dodge phase asserts at least one dodge and fewer",
    "reflections than swings; a rare swing that lands still reflects once (positions and facing recorded)."
  ],
